WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Construct. Use local metre coordinates to define a known teaching surface.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Differentiate. Calculate how elevation changes over distance, then express slope in degrees.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Link views. Trace a fixed cross-section through the same surface shown in contours and 3D.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Question. Change vertical exaggeration and see why camera appearance is not a new measurement.
